MultiFlexi Executor Kubernetes helper package
=============================================

This package provides the Kubernetes executor class for MultiFlexi and
ships a ready-to-apply RBAC manifest for the multiflexi namespace.

Quick install path (see full docs for details)
----------------------------------------------

1. apt install multiflexi-executor multiflexi-executor-k8s
2. Install kubectl (and helm if applications use helmchart)
3. kubectl create namespace multiflexi
4. kubectl apply -f /usr/share/multiflexi/k8s/multiflexi-executor-rbac.yaml
5. Mint a kubeconfig for ServiceAccount multiflexi-executor and install it::

     sudo mkdir -p /var/lib/multiflexi/.kube
     sudo install -o multiflexi -g multiflexi -m 0600 \
       ./multiflexi-executor.kubeconfig \
       /var/lib/multiflexi/.kube/config

6. Add to /etc/multiflexi/multiflexi.env::

     KUBECONFIG=/var/lib/multiflexi/.kube/config
     MULTIFLEXI_K8S_NAMESPACE=multiflexi

7. systemctl restart multiflexi-executor

8. Set runtemplate executor=Kubernetes; application needs ociimage
   (helmchart and artifacts are optional)

Full guide: https://multiflexi.eu/ (Kubernetes Integration) or the
multiflexi-doc-en source file integrations/kubernetes.rst.
